       <div class=\"course-info\"><span>每周六</span><span>10:00 - 11:30</span></div>\n          <div class=\"course-price\">¥799 <small>/ 10 节课</small></div>\n          <button class=\"btn-outline\" data-oey-object=\"courses.yin-btn\">报名此课程</button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"booking\" id=\"booking\" data-oey-section=\"booking\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\" data-oey-object=\"booking.title\">课程报名</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\" data-oey-object=\"booking.subtitle\">填写以下信息，我们将在 24 小时内与你确认</p>\n      <div class=\"booking-box\">\n        <form>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label for=\"name\" data-oey-object=\"booking.name-label\">姓名</label>\n            <input id=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"请输入您的姓名\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label for=\"phone\" data-oey-object=\"booking.phone-label\">联系电话</label>\n            <input id=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"请输入手机号码\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label for=\"course\" data-oey-object=\"booking.course-label\">选择课程</label>\n            <select id=\"course\">\n              <option>哈他瑜伽 · 入门班</option>\n              <option>流瑜伽 · 活力班</option>\n              <option>阴瑜伽 · 疗愈班</option>\n              <option>免费体验课</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"form-row\">\n            <label for=\"msg\" data-oey-object=\"booking.msg-label\">留言（可选）</label>\n            <textarea id=\"msg\" placeholder=\"例如：练习经验、身体情况或期望的上课时间\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-submit\" data-oey-object=\"booking.submit\">提交报名</button>\n          <div class=\"form-note\" data-oey-object=\"booking.note\">提交即视为同意工作室的预约与取消规则。</div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\" data-oey-section=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\